<!DOCTYPE document SYSTEM "http://commons.omniupdate.com/dtd/standard.dtd"> 

<document xmlns:ouc="http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables">
	
	<headcode></headcode> <!-- before closing head tag -->
	<bodycode></bodycode> <!-- after opening body tag -->
	<footcode></footcode> <!-- before closing body tag -->
	
	<ouc:info>
		<tcf>interior.tcf</tcf>
		<tmpl>interior.tmpl</tmpl>
	</ouc:info>
	
	<ouc:properties label="config">				
		<parameter name="heading" type="text" group="Everyone" prompt="Page Heading" alt="Enter the page heading text. Not displayed if left blank.">ISSI Jobs</parameter>
		<parameter name="breadcrumb" type="text" group="Everyone" prompt="Breadcrumb" alt="Not displayed for index pages. Page title by default.">ISSI Jobs</parameter>
		<parameter section="Top of Page Media" name="top-media" type="select" group="Everyone" prompt="Banner / Slider" alt="Choose between banner or slider for the top of the page media. Turn it off to hide the banner or use the snippet version.">
<option value="slider" selected="false">Slider</option>
<option value="banner" selected="false">Banner</option>
<option value="off" selected="true">Off</option>
</parameter>

		<parameter section="Banner Properties" name="banner" type="filechooser" group="Everyone" prompt="Banner Image" alt="Select a banner image."></parameter>
		<parameter name="banner-alt" type="text" group="Everyone" prompt="Banner Alt-Text" alt="Enter the alternate text for the banner image."></parameter>

		<parameter section="Page Layout" name="layout" type="select" group="Everyone" prompt="Number of Columns" alt="Switch between two or three column layout.">
<option value="two" selected="true">Two Column</option>
<option value="three" selected="false">Three Column</option>
</parameter>		

		<parameter section="LDP Gallery" name="gallery-type" type="select" group="Everyone" prompt="Gallery Type" alt="Select the output type for gallery assets on this page.">
<option value="flex-slider" selected="true">Flex Slider</option>
<option value="magnific-popup" selected="false">Magnific PopUp</option>
<option value="pretty-photo" selected="false">Pretty Photo</option>
<option value="fancy-box" selected="false">Fancy Box</option>
</parameter>
	</ouc:properties>
	
	<ouc:properties label="metadata">
		<title>ISSI Hiring | Lake Tahoe Community College</title>
		<meta name="Description" content="Explore job opportunities with LTCC’s Intensive Spanish Summer Institute. Learn more about roles supporting immersive Spanish language learning." />
	</ouc:properties>
	
	<ouc:div label="gallery" group="Everyone" button-text="Select Slider">
		<ouc:editor wysiwyg="gallery" csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt"/>		
	</ouc:div>
	
	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><p>Lake Tahoe Community College is hiring for this year&rsquo;s Intensive Spanish Summer Institute (ISSI), an immersive program focused on language learning and cultural connection.</p>
<p>We are seeking candidates for two roles that support student learning in and out of the classroom:</p>
<ul>
<li><a title="Learn more about this position" href="https://ltcc.peopleadmin.com/postings/2695" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Adjunct Faculty, Intensive Spanish Summer Institute</strong></a><br />Teach courses within the Spanish curriculum, support student learning, and guide instruction across in-person or online formats.</li>
<li><a title="Learn more about this position" href="https://ltcc.peopleadmin.com/postings/2261" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Conversation Aide, ISSI</strong></a><br />Lead small-group Spanish conversation sessions, support classroom instruction, and help create a positive, inclusive learning environment.</li>
</ul>
<p>ISSI is a collaborative, student-centered program. These roles are well-suited for individuals interested in language education and working closely with students.</p></ouc:div>

	<ouc:div label="right-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Right Column Content">
		<ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="right-content"/>
		<h2>Edit Title</h2>
		<p>Edit Content</p>
	</ouc:div>
	
</document>
